## 📁 Repository Structure

```
teleshield/
├── quantum/          # Pure/mixed states, Pauli algebra, Bell states, Teleportation, Kraus noise
├── backends/         # QuantumBackend abstraction: Exact, Aer, Stim, Pulser
├── qds/              # Key generation, Teleportation distribution, Signer, Verifier, Session
├── qstat/            # Q-STAT: Envelope, Freshness, Auth, Integrity, Binomial, SPRT, CUSUM, Fingerprint
├── attacks/          # Forgery, Splice, Impersonation, Replay, Intercept-Resend, Channel, Unauthorized
├── security/         # Hoeffding bounds, Parameter calculator, Protocol thresholds
├── hardware/         # Hardware profiles loader & validation
├── audit/            # SHA-256 append-only hash chain
├── database/         # Local SQLite models and repository
├── experiments/      # 14 Research experiments (E01 - E14) & ExperimentRunner
├── analysis/         # Performance tracker, Plotly visualizers, Report generators
├── api/              # FastAPI application (main.py)
├── dashboard/        # Streamlit 6-page interactive cybersecurity application
├── profiles/         # YAML hardware profiles (ideal, ion_trap, rydberg)
├── config/           # Central configuration (config.yaml)
├── docs/             # Formal mathematical, architecture, and security documentation
└── tests/            # Automated test suite (32 unit & regression tests)
```

